    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/REALOIYO/dsh-plugin-market/commit/c235698f97bc706493fbe64dfbd89f5041a48ce0"/>
    <title>
        Fix coverage gap and add star/download sorting
    </title>
    <updated>2026-10-17T13:08:32Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://2.gravatar.com/avatar/fa3ee690bbfd88026fbe7b722c11e7d8?d=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.githubassets.com%2Fimages%2Fgravatars%2Fgravatar-user-420.png&amp;r=g&amp;s=30"/>
    <author>
      <name></name>
      <email>dsh-user@users.noreply.github.com</email>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Fix coverage gap and add star/download sorting

- search npm via curl: the search endpoint returns 404 through Node fetch on
  some networks, which left packages such as dsh-our-free-model out of the
  seed-only discovery
- sort versions by SemVer so versions[0] is the highest, matching the reader
- add stars and downloads sort keys so the UI can rank by popularity
- install the validator from npm so CI can check without a local DSH&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
