    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/REALOIYO/dsh-plugin-market/commit/0651296dd4e4fb6023bf55a17c75787d0237be4b"/>
    <title>
        Expand index to all 4,838 installable DSH bundles
    </title>
    <updated>2026-10-17T11:51:47Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://2.gravatar.com/avatar/fa3ee690bbfd88026fbe7b722c11e7d8?d=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.githubassets.com%2Fimages%2Fgravatars%2Fgravatar-user-420.png&amp;r=g&amp;s=30"/>
    <author>
      <name></name>
      <email>dsh-user@users.noreply.github.com</email>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Expand index to all 4,838 installable DSH bundles

- discovery from seed lists instead of the npm search endpoint, which is
  blocked by middleboxes on some networks
- compress each packument immediately so memory stays constant (the earlier
  batch-everything approach ran out of heap at 18k packages)
- reject empty results instead of overwriting a good index
- sanitize repository.directory, which must not be &amp;quot;.&amp;quot; or contain illegal chars
- add cross-check against dsh.so security scans (4838/4838 matched, 0 high risk)&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
