    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Add DSH plugin market index (format 1) with generator and validators

- index.json: 22 bundles pinned to published npm versions
- build-index.mjs: generate format-1 index from npm package names
- tools/: validate against the real DSH validator extracted from app.asar,
  reproduce the host fetch path, and audit for private data before publishing&lt;/pre&gt;
